WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.947
The first step in text cleaning is inspection Run
this query and look closely

00:00:05.973 --> 00:00:11.615
at names emails and addresses Do not decide on a
cleaning rule

00:00:11.641 --> 00:00:17.159
before you understand the patterns that actually
occur Some values may

00:00:17.185 --> 00:00:23.403
have extra spaces inconsistent capitalization or
abbreviations The

00:00:23.430 --> 00:00:28.048
cleaning rule should respond to observed problems
not blindly transform every string
